   .:[ events : signal names a zenka may raise ]:.

## `events.signal <name> [ key=value .. ]` : the cube routes the command   ##
## [ access.zenki : `events.signal` in the zenka's list ] and records the  ##
## raising zenka [ source_zenka alias ] ; this file decides which names    ##
## each zenka may raise :                                                  ##
##   events.signal.<zenka> = <name> <prefix>.* ..  [ `*` : every name ]    ##
##   events.signal.*       = ..                    [ every zenka ]         ##
## `=` and `:` are equivalent, backslash continues a line. e.g. :          ##
##   events.signal.kimi    = kimi.run.done                                 ##
##   events.signal.coding  = coding.* task.*                               ##
##   events.signal.claude  = claude.run.done                               ##
##   events.signal.usage   = usage.*                                       ##
##     [ usage.window.reset provider= window= , usage.threshold provider=  ##
##       window= percent= used= crossed=up|down : budget gates wake on     ##
##       them ; not granted here, the owner does ]                         ##
## nothing is granted yet -- a zenka gets its names when it starts raising ##

   events.signal.usage   =  usage.*        # owner 2026-11-24
   events.signal.claude  =  claude.run.done  # owner 2026-11-24
   events.signal.kimi    =  kimi.run.done    # owner 2026-11-24

